   337	The \(S_5\) target is forced counterfactually: the branch locus is \(D\),
   338	the generic meridian has cycle type \((2,1,1,1)\), and connected global
   339	monodromy is a transitive group generated by transpositions, hence
   340	\(S_5\).  Likewise, the three-letter local orbit is transitive and its
