+so there must be at least five multibranch affine singularities. Packet (4.2)--(4.3) is only a necessary aggregate stratum. It is not an attainment claim and not a Keller example. No promoted statement in the charged inputs excludes its ramified quadratic \(h_l\). Closing it, or proving the missing general inequality \(2a\le N\), goes beyond this mechanism; compare the named T3.5-SHARPEN successor at **B0:584--586**.
