+Both \(h\)'s have degree one, so the correction cannot be absorbed in a cover. This is exactly the common-normalization contradiction at **N5:252--318**. Theorem 4.1 recovers it and excludes every H2 trivial profile through \(N=10\). Together with the promoted \(N=4\) theorem (**Coord:49--55**),
