+
+> **Theorem 4.1 (eta/cover obstruction under H2).** Let \(F\) be a
+> noninvertible plane Keller map of geometric degree \(N\), and assume
+> \(D=A_F\) is irreducible. If an affine-image dicritical has \(\mu_0=1\),
