+- S. Yu. Orevkov, “On three-sheeted polynomial mappings of \(\mathbb C^2\),” refs/jc86.pdf, SHA-256
+  f80d4a7d7e04987ce7dece58f33cff20ea9210183ca3ffd4488f39a2147532db.
+  Lemma 2.1 is on PDF p. 2; Lemma 5.2 is on pp. 8--9.
+- H. Żołądek, “An application of Newton--Puiseux charts to the Jacobian problem,” refs/zoladek2008_official.pdf, SHA-256
+  88d5a35414ad11ffc96e32551810ef773e88be2db12ce39478c964cb602149ad.
