+### 5.2 Reducible \(A_F\)
+
+At \(N=4\), the exact remaining configuration is the coordinator's repair, not printed Theorem 4.3(5), which **Coord:56--66,108--111** refutes. There are two dicriticals over distinct components,
+
+\[
